{
  "format": "specula.ui.screen.v1",
  "name": "controls",
  "input": "menu",
  "layer": 30,
  "modal": true,
  "back": "close_controls",
  "opened_by": ["open_controls", "help"],
  "focus": "controls_back",
  "notes": "The controls, and rebinding (docs/design/ACCESSIBILITY.md). State: bindings (rows: label = what the action does, kbm = its keyboard and mouse inputs, pad = its gamepad inputs, rebindable = a button the player may rebind, conflict = the other actions on the same input, absent when none), rebind_status (what the screen is waiting for: \"Press a key for Call wave (Esc cancels)\", or what the last rebind did; absent when nothing). Pressing a row's keyboard or gamepad button listens for the next input from that device and binds it (row actions rebind_kbm@row and rebind_pad@row: the game reads the row from the widget, bind_kbm[N]); an input another action already uses is bound too and both rows show the conflict. Listening is the player's own: an agent's press is refused (agents set bindings with play_settings {bind}). Actions: reset_bindings, close_controls.",
  "root": {
    "type": "box",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "panel",
        "style": "menu",
        "anchor": "center",
        "width": "36em",
        "max_width": "96%",
        "max_height": "94%",
        "layout": "column",
        "align": "stretch",
        "gap": 8,
        "children": [
          { "type": "label", "text": "@controls.controls", "role": "title", "text_align": "center", "visible": "!ui.short" },
          { "type": "label", "text": "{rebind_status}", "role": "small", "text_align": "center", "visible": "has_rebind_status" },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "id": "binding_list",
            "height": "fill",
            "gap": 4,
            "padding": [0, 12, 0, 0],
            "repeat": {
              "source": "bindings",
              "max": 24,
              "template": {
                "type": "box",
                "layout": "column",
                "padding": [2, 6],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "box", "layout": "row", "justify": "space_between", "align": "center", "gap": 8,
                    "children": [
                      { "type": "label", "text": "{item.label}", "role": "body", "width": "fill" },
                      { "type": "button", "id": "bind_kbm", "style": "compact", "min_width": 96, "min_height": 44, "text": "{item.kbm}", "action": "rebind_kbm@row", "enabled": "item.rebindable", "tooltip": "@controls.bind_kbm_tip" },
                      { "type": "button", "id": "bind_pad", "style": "compact", "min_width": 96, "min_height": 44, "text": "{item.pad}", "action": "rebind_pad@row", "enabled": "item.rebindable", "tooltip": "@controls.bind_pad_tip" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "label", "text": "{item.conflict}", "role": "small", "color": "fire", "visible": "item.has_conflict" }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "box",
            "layout": "row",
            "gap": 10,
            "children": [
              { "type": "button", "id": "reset_bindings", "text": "@controls.reset_to_defaults", "action": "reset_bindings", "width": "fill" },
              { "type": "button", "id": "controls_back", "style": "primary", "text": "@controls.back", "action": "close_controls", "width": "fill" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
